# --- Local model weights ---
#
# Downloaded, not authored: multi-gigabyte binaries that git stores badly and
# cannot diff. A single 7B checkpoint is ~4.7 GB, which is larger than every
# other file in this repo combined and above GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard
# limit — a push would be rejected after uploading the lot.
#
# models/README.md documents which weights to fetch and pins the exact repo
# and filename, so the directory is reproducible from a clone without the
# bytes living in history.
# Contents, not the directory itself: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so `models/` + `!models/README.md` would leave the README
# unreachable and untracked.
models/*
!models/README.md

# Weight formats, wherever they land — a stray checkpoint outside models/
# should not slip in either.
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth

# Real values, filled in per deploy; the .example is the tracked template.
frontend/.env.production

# Unlike .env.production, the Android build's Worker address is a deliberately
# public, stable endpoint. It contains neither a tunnel hostname nor a secret,
# so keeping it in version control makes a reproducible mobile build possible.
!frontend/.env.mobile
# The values inside these templates are deliberately public placeholders.
# Keep them versioned so a fresh clone can configure each build target.
!frontend/.env.mobile.example
!frontend/.env.production.example

# Claude Code: the shared project config (.claude/settings.json, .mcp.json)
# is committed on purpose. Personal overrides are not -- settings.local.json
# is where a machine-specific secret would land, such as the Atlas
# connection string the mongodb MCP server needs.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Wrangler's local state: the simulated KV store and dev cache that
# `wrangler dev` writes. Machine-local, and it contains whatever tunnel
# hostname was last pointed at during development.
frontend/.wrangler/

# Generated edge authentication shared by the Worker and laptop containers.
deploy/laptop/edge.env
deploy/laptop/app.env
deploy/laptop/mongo.env
deploy/laptop/runtime-secrets.json
deploy/laptop/app.private.env
deploy/laptop/mongo.private.env
deploy/laptop/runtime-secrets.private.json
deploy/laptop/rotation.private.json
deploy/laptop/runtime-secrets.private.json.pending
backups/
